# z.library's jump table, as GFOpenZlib builds it: LVO, call, registers.
# The order and registers are the Aminet z.library's (util/libs/z_lib on
# Aminet; its interface file z_lib.sfd, read on 6 November 2026 from its
# BSD-licensed source on GitHub, salass00/z_lib):
# 41 calls, -30 to -270, so a program built for it finds every call where
# it looks. Until 53.13 this table was guessed from zlib.h's order (no FD
# could be read then) and was wrong from -102 on.
# After the Aminet table, from -276, GFOpenZlib's own four, which the
# Aminet library doesn't have (deflatePending, inflateMark,
# zlibCompileFlags, deflateGetDictionary): a newer Aminet library that
# adds calls there would clash with them.
# build-amiga.sh checks this against z_lib.fd or z_lib.sfd when FD= names
# one (../common/check_fd.py); ZlibABITest's PROBE run against the Aminet
# z.library shows it in use. openzlib_lib.c's lib_vectors[] follows it
# line for line.
# Core class (OPEN_LIBRARIES.md, section 5): every call is pure (the
# checksums, the bounds, ZlibVersion) or locked per stream: the caller's
# own z_stream, whose state the library never shares.
-30 ZlibVersion
-36 DeflateInit a0,d0
-42 Deflate a0,d0
-48 DeflateEnd a0
-54 InflateInit a0
-60 Inflate a0,d0
-66 InflateEnd a0
-72 DeflateInit2 a0,d0,d1,d2,d3,d4
-78 DeflateSetDictionary a0,a1,d0
-84 DeflateCopy a0,a1
-90 DeflateReset a0
-96 DeflateParams a0,d0,d1
-102 InflateInit2 a0,d0
-108 InflateSetDictionary a0,a1,d0
-114 InflateReset a0
-120 Compress a0,a1,a2,d0
-126 Uncompress a0,a1,a2,d0
-132 Adler32 d0,a0,d1
-138 CRC32 d0,a0,d1
-144 InflateSync a0
-150 DeflateTune a0,d0,d1,d2,d3
-156 DeflateBound a0,d0
-162 DeflatePrime a0,d0,d1
-168 DeflateSetHeader a0,a1
-174 InflateCopy a0,a1
-180 InflatePrime a0,d0,d1
-186 InflateGetHeader a0,a1
-192 InflateBackInit a0,d0,a1
-198 InflateBack a0,a1,d0,a2,d1
-204 InflateBackEnd a0
-210 Adler32Combine d0,d1,d2
-216 CRC32Combine d0,d1,d2
-222 Compress2 a0,a1,a2,d0,d1
-228 CompressBound d0
-234 InflateGetDictionary a0,a1,a2
-240 ZError d0
-246 Uncompress2 a0,a1,a2,a3
-252 InflateReset2 a0,d0
-258 InflateValidate a0,d0
-264 CRC32CombineGen d0
-270 CRC32CombineOp d0,d1,d2
-276 DeflatePending a0,a1,a2  # beyond the fd: GFOpenZlib's own
-282 InflateMark a0  # beyond the fd: GFOpenZlib's own
-288 ZlibCompileFlags  # beyond the fd: GFOpenZlib's own
-294 DeflateGetDictionary a0,a1,a2  # beyond the fd: GFOpenZlib's own
